  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to The Winking Turtle, a bright and spacious 3-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom vacation home designed for fun, relaxation, and unforgettable memories!<br><br>Comfortably sleeping up to 10 guests, this coastal retreat features a king bed in the primary suite, a full bed in the second bedroom, a twin-over-full bunk with twin trundle in the third, plus a sleeper sofa; perfect for families, friends, or multi-generational getaways. Inside, you’ll find an open-concept living and dining area with plenty of seating, a fully equipped kitchen for easy meal prep, and thoughtful coastal décor that brings beachy charm to every corner. <br><br>Step outside to enjoy the sunny backyard, ideal for kids, pets, or simply soaking up the fresh air. With nearby beaches, local dining, shopping, and attractions just minutes away, adventure is always close at hand. <br><br>Whether you’re unwinding after a day in the sun, hosting a game night, or sharing a meal on the patio, The Winking Turtle provides all the comfort, space, and coastal vibes you need for the ultimate beach getaway.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 10)<br>• Bedroom 1: 1 King Bed<br>• Bedroom 2: 1 Full Bed<br>• Bedroom 3: 1 Twin over Full Bunk Bed** and 1 Twin Trundle Bed<br>• Living Area: 1 Sleeper Sofa<br>**Please Note: ALL Top Bunks have a weight limit of 100lbs<br><br>Blue Swell Vacation Rentals is a boutique property management company that specializes in top-of-the-line, luxury beach rentals from PCB, 30A, and Destin. Our loyal guests come back year after year because of the exclusive homes and condos we offer as well as the excellent service we provide. Our keyless entry, premier linens with 300 thread count sheets, plush towels, and high-end starter supplies are just the beginning of the convenient amenities we provide for every guest. Most importantly, Blue Swell’s phone service allows our guests to experience the best vacation ever with less stress. It is always a SWELL day at the beach!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "The Winking Turtle – Your Shell-tered Beach Escape! Sleeps 10!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    }
